; VolumeGapCascadeEA - faithful to the Pine v3 indicator: H1 top, Tehran 23:30/00:30 exclusion, wait 4 x M15,
; limit orders at all four boxes (H1, M15, M5, M1), SL beyond each box + 0.1 ATR(H1), TP 1.5R, hold max 24h.
; Use this to reproduce the indicator's BUY/SELL labels as trades. In the study this lost ~0.1-0.5R per trade.
